msgid "ShipStatic"
msgstr "ShipStatic"

#. Description of the plugin
#: shipstatic.php
msgid ""
"Publish your WordPress site as static HTML over SFTP/FTP, HTTPS, Cloudflare "
"or GitHub Pages. Bricks-aware; works with any WordPress content."
msgstr ""
"Publiez votre site WordPress en HTML statique via SFTP/FTP, HTTPS, "
"Cloudflare ou GitHub Pages. Compatible Bricks ; fonctionne avec tout contenu"
" WordPress."

#. Author of the plugin
#: shipstatic.php
msgid "BRXProd"
msgstr "BRXProd"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: shipstatic.php
msgid "https://brxprod.com"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:104
msgid "Inspect and drive the ShipStatic export/sync engine."
msgstr ""
"Inspectez et pilotez le moteur d'export/synchronisation de ShipStatic."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:115
msgid "Get sync status"
msgstr "Obtenir l'état de synchronisation"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:116
msgid ""
"Returns whether a destination is connected, whether anything has been "
"pushed, and whether the static copy is in sync, plus the resolved sync "
"method and discovery mode."
msgstr ""
"Indique si une destination est connectée, si quelque chose a été envoyé et "
"si la copie statique est synchronisée, ainsi que la méthode de "
"synchronisation et le mode de découverte résolus."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:121
msgid "Get sync method"
msgstr "Obtenir la méthode de synchronisation"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:122
msgid ""
"Returns how a sync will run: discovery mode, transport, compression, server "
"target and link style."
msgstr ""
"Indique comment une synchronisation s'exécutera : mode de découverte, "
"transport, compression, serveur cible et style de liens."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:127
msgid "List exportable pages"
msgstr "Lister les pages exportables"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:128
msgid ""
"Lists published, public posts/pages with their static-export state: whether "
"each is included, whether it will actually export under the current plan, "
"and whether it is currently synced."
msgstr ""
"Liste les articles/pages publiés et publics avec leur état d'export statique"
" : si chacun est inclus, s'il sera réellement exporté selon le plan actuel "
"et s'il est actuellement synchronisé."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:133
msgid "Get page sync status"
msgstr "Obtenir l'état de synchronisation d'une page"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:134
msgid ""
"For one post, returns its include/effective/synced state and per-destination"
" push state."
msgstr ""
"Pour une publication, indique son état d'inclusion/effectif/synchronisé et "
"l'état d'envoi par destination."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:140
msgid "Check page link integrity"
msgstr "Vérifier l'intégrité des liens d'une page"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:141
msgid ""
"For one post, reports internal links that point to pages NOT in the export "
"(outbound) and currently-included pages that link TO it (inbound) — the data"
" behind the manual-mode link-integrity warnings."
msgstr ""
"Pour une publication, signale les liens internes pointant vers des pages NON"
" incluses dans l'export (sortants) et les pages actuellement incluses qui "
"pointent VERS elle (entrants) — les données à l'origine des avertissements "
"d'intégrité des liens en mode manuel."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:147
msgid "List destinations"
msgstr "Lister les destinations"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:148
msgid ""
"Lists the configured deploy destinations by name, transport type and enabled"
" state. Never returns credentials."
msgstr ""
"Liste les destinations de déploiement configurées par nom, type de transport"
" et état d'activation. Ne retourne jamais d'identifiants."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:153
msgid "Get sync progress"
msgstr "Obtenir la progression de la synchronisation"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:154
msgid ""
"Returns the current sync job snapshot (phase, counts, totals, recent errors)"
" — useful for polling a run started elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"Retourne un instantané de la tâche de synchronisation en cours (phase, "
"décomptes, totaux, erreurs récentes) — utile pour suivre une exécution "
"lancée ailleurs."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:162
msgid "Set discovery mode"
msgstr "Définir le mode de découverte"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:163
msgid "Sets how pages are discovered for export: \"linked\", \"all\" or \"manual\"."
msgstr ""
"Définit la manière dont les pages sont découvertes pour l'export : « linked "
"», « all » ou « manual »."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:172
msgid "The discovery mode to set."
msgstr "Le mode de découverte à définir."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:180
msgid "Include or exclude a page"
msgstr "Inclure ou exclure une page"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:181
msgid ""
"In manual discovery mode, sets whether a single post is included in the "
"static export."
msgstr ""
"En mode de découverte manuelle, définit si un article donné est inclus dans "
"l'export statique."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:187 src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:327
msgid "The post ID."
msgstr "L'identifiant de la publication."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:188
msgid "True to include, false to exclude."
msgstr "True pour inclure, false pour exclure."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:195
msgid "Include multiple pages"
msgstr "Inclure plusieurs pages"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:196
msgid ""
"In manual discovery mode, includes a batch of posts (e.g. the cascade when "
"enabling a page that links to others)."
msgstr ""
"En mode de découverte manuelle, inclut un lot d'articles (p. ex. la cascade "
"lorsqu'on active une page qui pointe vers d'autres)."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:205
msgid "The post IDs to include."
msgstr "Les identifiants des publications à inclure."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:217
msgid "Scan (dry run)"
msgstr "Analyser (simulation)"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:218
msgid ""
"Starts a check run: renders the pages and reports what would change, without"
" pushing anything to a destination."
msgstr ""
"Lance une vérification : rend les pages et signale ce qui changerait, sans "
"rien envoyer vers une destination."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:224 src/Support/I18n.php:270
#: src/Support/I18n.php:650
msgid "Sync"
msgstr "Synchroniser"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:225
msgid ""
"Starts a full sync: renders the pages and pushes the static copy to the "
"destination(s)."
msgstr ""
"Lance une synchronisation complète : rend les pages et envoie la copie "
"statique vers la ou les destinations."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:230
msgid "Sync a single page"
msgstr "Synchroniser une seule page"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:231
msgid ""
"Renders one page (and any new internal pages it links to) and pushes only "
"the changed files to destinations opted into single-page sync."
msgstr ""
"Rend une page (et toute nouvelle page interne qu'elle lie) et n'envoie que "
"les fichiers modifiés vers les destinations ayant activé la synchronisation "
"page par page."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:237
msgid "The internal page URL to sync."
msgstr "L'URL de la page interne à synchroniser."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:243
msgid "Cancel sync"
msgstr "Annuler la synchronisation"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:244
msgid "Requests cancellation of the running sync job."
msgstr "Demande l'annulation de la tâche de synchronisation en cours."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:250 src/Support/I18n.php:317
msgid "Reset sync state"
msgstr "Réinitialiser l'état de synchronisation"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:251
msgid ""
"Clears the local record of what has been pushed so the next sync re-uploads "
"everything. Destructive: does not delete remote files but forces a full re-"
"upload."
msgstr ""
"Efface l'historique local de ce qui a été envoyé afin que la prochaine "
"synchronisation re-téléverse tout. Destructif : ne supprime pas les fichiers"
" distants mais force un re-téléversement complet."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:427 src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:462
#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:569
msgid "A valid post ID is required."
msgstr "Un identifiant de publication valide est requis."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:513
msgid "Inbound links reflect the most recent scan/sync."
msgstr "Les liens entrants reflètent la dernière analyse/synchronisation."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:572
msgid "You cannot edit this post."
msgstr "Vous ne pouvez pas modifier cette publication."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:634
msgid "A valid internal page URL is required."
msgstr "Une URL de page interne valide est requise."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:637
msgid "No destinations are enabled for single-page sync."
msgstr ""
"Aucune destination n'est activée pour la synchronisation page par page."

#: src/Admin/Editor.php:126
msgid "Static"
msgstr "Statique"

#: src/Admin/Editor.php:151
msgid "In sync — open to re-sync"
msgstr "Synchronisé — ouvrir pour resynchroniser"

#: src/Admin/Editor.php:152
msgid "Out of date — open to sync"
msgstr "Obsolète — ouvrir pour synchroniser"

#: src/Admin/Editor.php:153
msgid "Not in the static export — open to manage"
msgstr "Absent de l’export statique — ouvrir pour gérer"

#: src/Admin/Editor.php:154
msgid "Run a check or sync to see status"
msgstr "Lancez une vérification ou une synchronisation pour voir le statut"

#: src/Admin/Menu.php:108
msgid "Dashboard"
msgstr "Tableau de bord"

#: src/Admin/Menu.php:116 src/Admin/Menu.php:117
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Documentation"

#: src/Admin/Menu.php:160
msgid ""
"ShipStatic: the admin assets are not built. Run \"npm run build\" in the "
"plugin directory."
msgstr ""
"ShipStatic : les ressources d'administration ne sont pas compilées. Exécutez"
" « npm run build » dans le répertoire du plugin."

