#: src/Support/I18n.php:273
msgid "Use ShipStatic search on the WordPress site too"
msgstr "Utiliser la recherche ShipStatic aussi sur le site WordPress"

#: src/Support/I18n.php:274
msgid ""
"The ShipStatic Search element then searches as you type on this WordPress "
