msgstr ""
"« Pages to include » a changé depuis le dernier « Tout traiter », ce qui "
"affecte tout l’export. Utilisez « Tout traiter »."

#. translators: %s: page title(s).
#: src/Sync/Runner.php:299
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Nothing to process yet: %s isn’t linked from any page in the export, and "
"with Pages to include set to “Only linked pages” a page only joins the "
